[size=5][b]The Tower — gameplay development[/b][/size]

The Tower is an original game built on the Rust client and server. The intended progression combines authored floors, permanent character development, resource preparation and boss encounters.

[SPOILER=Arrival and sanctuary]

[i]Live native gameplay — The newer enclosed sanctuary, in the live Rust client.[/i]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/83e1b40d52b34bcbe50b5d9662f5a61a37bb2282/images/tower-gameplay/01-arrival.png[/img]

[/SPOILER]

[b]Preparation and restoration[/b]

The Cinderworks preparation route uses mining, smelting, smithing, fishing, cooking and bone offerings. Restoring the workshop, kitchen and altar unlocks the guardians. These captures show working services in the rebuilt floor.

