Preparation objectives can be completed in different orders. Smoke marks hazardous tiles. Coolant interrupts the Warden’s charge and creates an attack opening.

[b]Rewards and persistence[/b]

Earlier tests verify victory restoration, full-inventory reward refusal and duplicate-claim prevention. Skills, items and personal progress survive reconnects and recovery from a restart with committed saves.

[SPOILER=Victory, rewards and banking]

[i]Live native gameplay — Earlier playable floor: earned victory restores the floor and marks the reward as ready.[/i]
